{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f26d58c14b599b2f92a3f2ce244f9f87d3e86cbe1a2708b9d2805227d0aa8a80","ja":"今回のお仕事は遊園地の1日キャスト！\nまずはアトラクションの紹介から始まって……","zh":"这次的工作是游乐园的1日演职员！\n首先从介绍游乐设施开始……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bc36ef5dd667fd163f3ad266fad518c2b7a97951751dbbc079d5b549cdc349a4","ja":"たくさんあって迷っちゃいますよね！\n中でも私は、観覧車がオススメです♪","zh":"种类太多了，让人拿不定主意呢！\n其中我最推荐摩天轮哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"310f764f0e9c246d5ae369adda8f7b3762c40c047837e6e6ac3843d11a35a819","ja":"杏奈はVRコーナー！　目の前に迫力満点の景色が\nひろがって、ビビッとテンションアップだよ♪","zh":"杏奈在VR专区！震撼力十足的景色在眼前\n展开，一下子就嗨起来了哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"844d5aef84c054addf740a4ef36f8fa462d7256483d35dfa67faac02ced69374","ja":"私はコーヒーカップがイチオシです！\nさっきも乗ったんですよ～！","zh":"我最推荐咖啡杯！\n刚才我还去坐了呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"37b6d1ab7ab176bc8f4a415480b3cc21effa04925092b23bb2c4273908143362","ja":"ちょっと、目が回りすぎちゃいましたけど……。","zh":"虽然转得有点太头晕了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e00ae6a07d3cebb8dcb9fa653ab7af8005721cc706c997c3afe2a55c829aca8d","ja":"いや、あれは回しすぎだって！\nみんなも酔わないように注意しろよ？","zh":"不，那转得也太过头了吧！\n大家也要当心别晕了哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1b8bb509ff56a70e42482f77beec0e7c45d19d6f2910bd03e3fff8954f83cf08","ja":"あたしはバンジージャンプにロックを感じたな！\n思い切って挑戦してみるのもいいと思うぜ！","zh":"我觉得蹦极很摇滚呢！\n放手挑战一下也不错哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8106c1849d90f220213ea56e4f858da43c02f280b4277b6da539bc390ac62e83","ja":"ふふっ♪　それじゃあ私たちのガイドはここまで！\n引き続き楽しんでくださいね♪","zh":"呵呵♪　那么我们的向导就到此为止啦！\n接下来也请玩得开心哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1044.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f80a491ea03aa9e4ce4542812ca49ebcf9d9c5632d2024f9c851c6731075d5ed","ja":"杏奈たちは、この後もパレードと、\nミニライブに出演するよっ！","zh":"杏奈她们在这之后也还要参加游行，\n并在迷你演出中出场哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
